# Date: 2018-04-11
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1546.012, car.2013-01-002
# Description: Detects registry persistence technique using the GlobalFlags and SilentProcessExit keys
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((TargetObject CONTAIN "\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\" AND TargetObject CONTAIN "\\Image File Execution Options\\" AND TargetObject CONTAIN "\\GlobalFlag")) OR ((TargetObject CONTAIN "\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\" AND TargetObject CONTAIN "\\SilentProcessExit\\") AND (TargetObject CONTAIN "\\ReportingMode" OR TargetObject CONTAIN "\\MonitorProcess")))
